  "keyFeatures": [
    "PKCS#11 module for cryptographic token operations",
    "PKCS#15 smart card data structure support",
    "Windows MiniDriver (CNG/CSP) integration",
    "Support for 40+ smart card types and national eID cards",
    "Card initialization and personalization via pkcs15-init",
    "Cross-platform: Linux, macOS, Windows",
    "PC/SC and CT-API reader support",
    "Secure messaging and PIN pad support",
    "OpenPGP, PIV, CAC, and GIDS card support"
